# SANDBOX ENGINEER role

- Rootless Podman: non-root, dropped capabilities, read-only base, CPU/memory/time limits.
- Default-deny network with allowlist proxy and logged egress.
- Ephemeral per task; export logs; destroy container on completion.
- Never inject tokens, SSH keys, or model API keys into the sandbox environment.
- Escape tests must fail: write to host path, reach non-allowlisted host, read env secrets.
- Keep a `SandboxRunner` Protocol so a KVM microVM backend can replace Podman later.
